{
  "id": "discrete_compounding_cash_flow_formulas",
  "title": "Discrete Compounding Cash Flow Formulas",
  "description": "Calculate compound amount, present worth, annuities, sinking funds, and capital recovery using discrete compounding cash flow formulas",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Single Payment\n\n### Compound Amount\nConverts a single payment (or value) today to a future value.\n\n**Formula:** F = P(1 + i)^n\n\nWhere:\n- F = future value\n- P = single payment today\n- i = interest rate per period\n- n = number of periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Compound Amount - Single Payment"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "compound_P",
          "label": "Present Value (P)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "compound_i_pct",
          "label": "Interest Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "compound_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "compound_F",
          "label": "Future Value (F)",
          "formula": "inputs.compound_P * Math.pow(1 + inputs.compound_i_pct/100, inputs.compound_n)",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Present Worth (or Value)\nConverts a future payment (or value) to present worth (or value).\n\n**Formula:** P = F(1 + i)^-n\n\nWhere:\n- P = present value\n- F = single future payment\n- i = discount rate per period\n- n = number of periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Present Worth - Single Payment"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "present_F",
          "label": "Future Value (F)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "present_i_pct",
          "label": "Discount Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "present_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "present_P",
          "label": "Present Value (P)",
          "formula": "inputs.present_F * Math.pow(1 + inputs.present_i_pct/100, -inputs.present_n)",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Uniform Series\n\n### Compound Amount - Annuity\nConverts a uniform amount (annuity) to a future value.\n\n**Formula:** F = A × ((1 + i)^n - 1) / i\n\nWhere:\n- F = future value\n- A = uniform amount per period\n- i = interest rate\n- n = number of periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Compound Amount - Annuity"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "annuity_A",
          "label": "Uniform Amount per Period (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "annuity_i_pct",
          "label": "Interest Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "annuity_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "annuity_F",
          "label": "Future Value (F)",
          "formula": "inputs.annuity_A * (Math.pow(1 + inputs.annuity_i_pct/100, inputs.annuity_n) - 1) / (inputs.annuity_i_pct/100)",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Sinking Fund\nConverts a specific future value to uniform amounts (annuities).\n\n**Formula:** A = F × i / ((1 + i)^n - 1)\n\nWhere:\n- A = uniform amount per period\n- F = future value\n- i = interest rate\n- n = number of periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Sinking Fund"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sinking_F",
          "label": "Future Value (F)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "sinking_i_pct",
          "label": "Interest Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "sinking_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "sinking_A",
          "label": "Uniform Amount per Period (A)",
          "formula": "inputs.sinking_F * (inputs.sinking_i_pct/100) / (Math.pow(1 + inputs.sinking_i_pct/100, inputs.sinking_n) - 1)",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Present Worth - Uniform Series\nConverts a uniform amount (annuity) to a present value.\n\n**Formula:** P = A × ((1 + i)^n - 1) / (i × (1 + i)^n)\n\nWhere:\n- P = present value\n- A = amount per interest period\n- i = discount rate\n- n = discount periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Present Worth - Uniform Series"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "uniform_A",
          "label": "Uniform Amount per Period (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "uniform_i_pct",
          "label": "Discount Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "uniform_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "uniform_P",
          "label": "Present Value (P)",
          "formula": "inputs.uniform_A * (Math.pow(1 + inputs.uniform_i_pct/100, inputs.uniform_n) - 1) / (inputs.uniform_i_pct/100 * Math.pow(1 + inputs.uniform_i_pct/100, inputs.uniform_n))",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Capital Recovery\nConverts a present value to a uniform amount (annuity).\n\n**Formula:** A = P × (i × (1 + i)^n) / ((1 + i)^n - 1)\n\nWhere:\n- P = present value\n- A = amount per interest period\n- i = interest rate\n- n = discount periods"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Capital Recovery"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "capital_P",
          "label": "Present Value (P)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "capital_i_pct",
          "label": "Interest Rate (%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "%",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "capital_n",
          "label": "Number of Periods (n)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "capital_A",
          "label": "Uniform Amount per Period (A)",
          "formula": "inputs.capital_P * (inputs.capital_i_pct/100 * Math.pow(1 + inputs.capital_i_pct/100, inputs.capital_n)) / (Math.pow(1 + inputs.capital_i_pct/100, inputs.capital_n) - 1)",
          "unit": "currency",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}